heir version constraints for the development environment. Includes tox for testing, tox-pyenv and tox-gh-actions for CI integration, and core Python packages like virtualenv and setuptools.\nSOURCE: https://github.com/python-eel/eel/blob/main/requirements-meta.txt#2025-04-19_snippet_0\n\nLANGUAGE: text\nCODE:\n```\ntox>=3.15.2,<4.0.0\ntox-pyenv==1.1.0\ntox-gh-actions==2.0.0\nvirtualenv>=16.7.10\nsetuptools\n```', annotations=None)]
